review:
Pros.:
- Pixel art;
- The concept;
- The development of the rogue-like games;
- Strategic elements.

Cons.:
- Same over and over again. Low versatility.
- I couldn't evade the feeling that I'm just wasting time playing it. You may be buffed as hell and then lose in a room combat. It's simply stupid.

So, it's definitely now my type of games. But will be liked by others for sure.
